# K03 NS-ROLES-VIS (the author, 2026-10-07; semantics #declaration-visibility): a method's signature names a
# named Structure the unit defines BELOW the method -- an ordinary named Structure is visible from its place on,
# not above it (the S2 reading again: unknown type where the header stands; a positive while -07 Q2 stood).
# take would read its formal's field.  Refused at the signature.
fn: take (Point: p) size_t
    return: p\x
end: take
Point:
    size_t: x 5U
end: Point
fn: m () int
    pt: merge: Point
    pt\x: 7U
    if: take(pt) != 7U
        return: 81
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
